      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "INTELLECTUAL (1) was well backed fresh but pulled up with excuses when finishing fifth, only beaten 1.4L. Fitter and is drawn to advantage with Toeroek taking over. Looks the one. STAND ALONE (4) hit the line hard here two weeks ago when going down narrowly. Carries a fitness edge over a lot of her main dangers, which could prove pivotal. DAMELLI (7) was a barnstorming first-up winner when resuming last campaign. Has been fitted with two sharp jumpouts and can cause a late scare if the pace is genuine. BOHEMIAN ANGEL (3) just missed when resuming here last month. Has been freshened with 42 days and is drawn cosy. In the mix. ANAHORISH (6) will be hoping they overdo it in front so she can launch late. One for the exotics.",
